Device Traffic

Derived from luci-app-nlbw-history by EliotFerragni and its contributors:
https://github.com/EliotFerragni/luci-app-nlbw-history
Source baseline: 01667b1a03f98400a7fa35decdc3ceddb5b59abd (1.1.0).

The original Apache License, Version 2.0 is retained in LICENSE.

The initial downstream release was named Traffic Monitor. The project and
package were renamed to Device Traffic in version 1.0.1; runtime identifiers
are retained for compatibility.

The downstream package files have been modified for Device Traffic. Changes
include package/service/RPC/configuration namespaces, Live-first navigation,
device/IP tables, sorting, one-second live defaults, chart presentation,
24-hour usage, loading performance, and local-custom migration support.

nlbwmon remains a separate dependency, under its own upstream license.
